  m_text: 'The Golden Hand Millionaire :

    Richard Sinclair, a wealthy tycoon
    known for his ruthless business practices, came into possession of a cursed,
    golden mechanical hand rumored to have once belonged to a vengeful alchemist.
    This hand grants him immense wealth, but it also carries a dark curse that ties
    his fate to Father Gabriel''s unholy rituals.'
