  m_text: 'The Priest:

    Father Gabriel Leopold was once a respected priest in
    a small, isolated town. He was renowned for his sermons, but secretly practiced
    forbidden rituals in the church''s crypt. In his pursuit of divine power, he
    unwittingly made contact with a malevolent force, unknowingly binding his fate
    to the other characters.'
