  m_text: 'The Homeless:

    Ella "Ghost" Moreau is a homeless artist who wandered
    into the cursed town searching for inspiration. She discovered a mysterious old
    journal filled with sketches, scribbles, and occult symbols that detailed Father
    Gabriel''s forbidden rituals. Unbeknownst to her, her presence in the town is
    a critical link in the curse''s dark narrative.'
