  m_text: 'The Cultist Metal Singer:

    Alistair Blackthorn, a famous cultist metal
    singer, found Father Gabriel''s journal and incorporated its disturbing contents
    into his lyrics and stage performances. Little did he know that his charismatic
    influence drew in a growing cult of fans who sought to recreate the priest''s
    dark rituals, creating a horrifying following.'
